  "description": "Saint Violet comes to the prison to save the Holy Knight ‘Lahart’ who has been corrupted by the demonic energy. Violet decides to save Lahart using the only healing method found in the old book. Lahart regains his senses with her help, but neither of them can easily extinguish their desire for each other...\n\n(Source: Lezhin, translated)\n\n*Notes:\n\\- Part of Bomtoon and Lezhin's Baedeong Danpyeonseon (배덕 단편선) Collection.\n\\- Includes one extra chapter.*",
